# Bot1's Duress sees a hand with two eligible cards and takes the one the script names rather than the first.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Duress
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Guerrilla Gorilla
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Counterspell)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Duress
Bot2.Graveyard = Counterspell
Bot2.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Lightning Bolt; Guerrilla Gorilla
